eir social media Clips by  lecturing them that's what they want  they're not interested in passing  anything this is going to be up to the  NCAA leadership and the members  themselves to solve this you don't need  any of these state laws you've already  made  you've already made it legal to accept  these payments write your own rules if  you are afraid of getting taken to court  so be it you get taken to court over  everything else just do it and then see  what happens and don't rely on Congress  to act because they're not going to do  it  Dan great to talk to you again thanks  for joining us  thanks Dan appreciate it Dan wonkin USA  Today National columnist

